---
description: Talkdrop monorepo conventions
globs:
  - "**/*"
---

- Monorepo with pnpm workspaces. Packages: apps/web, apps/api, apps/worker, packages/shared, packages/ui.
- Product name is Talkdrop (never Meetglow in user-facing copy or package names).
- All request/response/socket payload types and zod schemas live in packages/shared.
- API: Fastify + zod + Prisma. Controllers thin, services hold logic. No raw SQL except migrations and matcher Lua.
- Web: React 18, Vite, React Router, TanStack Query, Zustand for ephemeral UI/call state.
- Styling: CSS variables from packages/ui/tokens.css. No hard-coded hex in components.
- Safety: never store raw video or audio. Evidence only via evidence path, encrypted, 24h expiry.
- Secrets only via environment variables; never commit .env. Provide .env.example.
- Decisions marked LOCKED in docs/SPEC.md (PostgreSQL, React, Node.js) must not change without approval.
